   "lines": [
    "Shifted my quarters",
    "to Ware's & Washburnes",
    "room, where I shall",
    "probably remain",
    "till Xmas. All the",
    "fellows have been",
    "very kind about",
    "asking me to share",
    "their rooms.",
    "Teddy Bayliss[?] came",
    "of age and gave",
    "a Porcellian breakfast",
    "in the club; it was",
    "great fun."
   ],
